*** Keywords ***

CB012533_D_B1_1
    [Documentation]       Verify that Radio Link Outage (RLO) is triggered when parameter actPathLoss is enabled.
    ...                   actPathLoss parameter is online modifiable.
    ...                   It shall not trigger either gNb restart or service outage when modifying the value of the parameters online
    [Arguments]           ${param}
    Init Sequence         ${param}
    STEP                  CB012533 Setup Mirroring     prefix=CB012533-D_cellreconfigurationreq
    STEP                  CB012533 Start Capture CPRT
    STEP                  Cell Setup    cell_number=${param.nbCell}
    ${listOfUes}          Build UEs list SA Multi UEs
    STEP                  SA Attach and Start Traffic Multi UEs       ${param}    ${listOfUes}
    STEP                  OAM Show FDD and TDD cell lists
    ${param_value}        Run Keyword If    ${isAic}    Step    OAM Get Param From Any Of SCF    param=actPathLoss
    ...                                                             current_scf=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    ...                                                             dist_name=${TNRCELL_DIST_NAME_DU[0]}    #NRCELL-1
    ...                               ELSE              Step    OAM Get Param From Any Of SCF    param=actPathLoss
    ...                                                             current_scf=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    ...                                                             dist_name=${TNRCELL_DIST_NAME[0]}    #NRCELL-1
    STEP                  Set actPathLoss Parameter
    STEP                  CB012533 Stop Capture CPRT
    STEP                  Check_actPathLoss_itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq        ${CAPTURE_CPRT}        ${actPathLoss_item}
    [Teardown]            Run Keywords      Produce Scout data      AND
    ...                                     GenericTest.Display diagnosis

Set actPathLoss Parameter
    [Documentation]      Modify some parameters in the database of the OAM set in arguments
    ...                  The keyword returns the Commissioning status (completed, ongoing or failed)
    ...                  - modifylist  : List of dictionaries like :
    ...                  [{'parameter': 'actPathLoss', 'dist_name': 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1', 'value': 'false'}, {}, ...]
    ...                  - oam : Oam identity (ex: ${GNB_DU.oam} or ${GNB_CU.oam}).
    ...                  - timeout : Max delay allowed for operation. Unit is seconds
    ${dist_name}       Set Variable    MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1
    &{param}=    Run Keyword If    ${isAic}    Create Dictionary    parameter=actPathLoss    dist_name=${dist_name}    value=false    nodeType=Vdu
    ...                      ELSE    Create Dictionary    parameter=actPathLoss    dist_name=${dist_name}    value=false
    ${modiflist}       Create List
    Append To List     ${modiflist}    ${param}
    Run Keyword If    ${isAic}    Oam Set Params AIC    ${modiflist}
    ...         ELSE    OAM.OAM Set Params     ${modiflist}

Check_actPathLoss_itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq
    [Documentation]
    ...     Actions:        Analysis of CPRT-L2PS messages
    ...     Checks:         Check that actPathLoss (Boolean) is set to 0 in message itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq
    ...     Verdict:        actPathLoss is set to 0 after cellreconfiguration procedure
    ...                     gNB shall not restart and there shall be no rservice outage in case of changing the value of the parameters online.
    ...                     Call shall not be dropped and UL/DL Traffic remains constant
    [Arguments]    ${CAPTURE_CPRT}    ${FieldShowName}
    Dated Log    Checking actPathLoss_item_0 in itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq structure
    Dated Log    pcap file : ${CAPTURE_CPRT.path}
    ${pdml}      analyzer.pcap_to_pdml      ${CAPTURE_CPRT.path}
    Dated Log    Pdml file conversion complete.
    # Apply a filter on a pcap file and generate a new pcap containing only selected packets
    ${CPRT_FilteredPcap}    analyzer.filter_pcap
    ...                     pcapInFile=${CAPTURE_CPRT.path}
    ...                     filterName=_filtered    # filterName : name of filter to add in root name of pcap
    ...                     filterExp=itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq
    ...                     otherFilter=-2
    Dated Log    Filtering message itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq and converting PCAP file ${CPRT_FilteredPcap} into Pdml format
    ${pdml_filteredPcap}      analyzer.pcap_to_pdml      ${CPRT_FilteredPcap}
    Dated Log    Pdm file saved under ${pdml_filteredPcap}
    # comparing Items
    ${msg_field}       Set Variable    @{FieldShowName.keys()}
    FOR     ${Field}   IN           @{msg_field}
            ${Value}          set variable    ${FieldShowName["${Field}"]}
            Dated Log         --- Check ${Field} = ${Value}
            # Check a pdml file, retrieving a particular packet and verifying a field exists at least once with a given value
            analyzer.check_exists_once     pdmlFile=${pdml_filteredPcap}    #${pdml}         # path of pdml file to parse after filtering
            ...                            packetName=itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq  # name of packet to retrieve
            ...                            path=${Field}                                     # regular expression of paths to retrieve
            ...                            value=${Value}                                    # expected value
            ...                            kind=showname      # field to compare : should be one of : "show", "showname" or "value"
            ...                            test=MATCH         # comparison to do : one of : ==, !=, <=, >=, <, >, MATCH (for string)
            ...                            startPacket=1      # index of starting packet to be considered
            ...                            endPacket=-1       # index of ending packet to be considered
    END
    [return]    ${pdml}

Delta commissioning of Json
    [Documentation]      Dedicated KW to commission gNB with delta json file
    [Arguments]          ${json_file}
    sbts_coam.connect_to    name=${gnb_alias}
    Run Keywords    coam_parameter.perform_scf_delta_commission    delta_file=${json_file}     connection=${gnb_alias}
    ...    AND
    ...             OAM wait available
    sbts_coam.teardown            connection=${gnb_alias}
